style='font-size:12.0pt'>PURPOSE</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoToc1><a href="#_Toc396901436"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.04</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none'>    </span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>DEFINITIONS</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoToc1><a href="#_Toc396901437"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.08</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none'>    </span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>ADMINISTRATION</span></a></p>

