APPROVED SUBDIVISIONS AND SHORT SUBDIVISIONS</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoToc1><a href="#_Toc396901440"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.20</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none'>    </span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>BINDING SITE PLANS</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoToc1><a href="#_Toc396901441"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.24</span><span
