style='font-size:12.0pt'>CONDOMINIUMS</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoToc1><a href="#_Toc396901442"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.28</span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;color:windowtext;text-decoration:none'>    </span><span
style='font-size:12.0pt'>ADJUSTMENTS</span></a></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.75in;text-indent:-.75in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<h1><a name="_Toc396901435"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.01         PURPOSE</span></a></h1>

<p class=MsoBodyText2><span style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Sections:</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:103.5pt;text-indent:-103.5pt'><b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        </span></b><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>19A.01.010   Purpose.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2><span style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          <b>19A.01.010  Purpose.</b>  The purpose of
this title is to:</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          A.  Establish the authority and procedures for
segregating land in King County.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          B.  Define and regulate divisions of land that
are exempt from the short subdivision or subdivision requirements.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          C.  Insure consistency with and implement the
King County Comprehensive Plan as amended in accordance with the Washington
State Growth Management Act, RCW 36.70A.120.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          D.  Require uniform monumenting of land
subdivisions and conveyance by accurate legal description.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          E.  Protect and preserve the public health,
safety and general welfare in accordance with the standards established by King
County and the state of Washington.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>          F.  Insure consistency with chapter 58.17 RCW. 
(Ord. 13694 § 2, 1999).</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<h1><a name="_Toc396901436"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>19A.04         DEFINITIONS</span></a></h1>

<p class=MsoBodyText2><span style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2><b><span style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Sections:</span></b></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.010      Acre.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.020      Alteration.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.030      Applicant.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.040      Binding
site plan.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.050      Building
envelope.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.060      Building
site.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.070      Civil
engineer.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.080      Condominium.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
style='font-size:12.0pt;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>        19A.04.082      Condominium
declaration.</span></p>

<p class=MsoBodyText2 style='margin-left:1.5in;text-indent:-1.5in'><span
